10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qquy0Bz18ycQ7kNvwH21_wC&_nc_oc=AdpwcO871wVCK2VvgHpO_I9tt3K6NOFXDO1y-DL0VVz4pCXzPHjlbduvtaBxcLKfaHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0zMka9_xVuX87MUiwYIjQ_xE_-PEj8vIVZxTrYOlWc1A&oe=69D9084C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MwyQxT9-VDMQ7kNvwEAYWR8&_nc_oc=AdpC8iwvHl27xgabw7wQJXr_lLpl2CV6l7hLL8fYCEhh4nqA6ytX1YclUM-5zg6yI1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0v02Khbw2tarmTH_yjLBNsfj4a17c6mfE7BWikdiooaQ&oe=69D8E0FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nt5BdqODJisQ7kNvwEY7S9O&_nc_oc=AdoS-_mhGd4tzSc795GKsZEEdjMCYRqA1tI4BSisJ4VbFHhHRN45c8g2UKuoFRj7Gqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0-zRIggZUEN9sYgvKTsG6fXS1X5ZFFa1UuX7KyJxod7Q&oe=69D8F82B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore